+## Checking against your budgets
+
+If you have set spending limits for your categories, the `budget` command shows
+how much you have spent in each category against those limits for the month:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+Each category appears with its actual spending alongside the configured budget,
+so you can see at a glance where you are over, under, or on track. Categories
+with no configured budget are still shown so nothing gets lost.
+
